 "notes": "Port of P.popCute. Tweens are written fromTo on the element: the 0.12 s fade-in comes first, then scale 0 -> 1 with the turn (v1 had them the other way round; same result, but the film stays invisible before `at` once the baker adds immediateRender:false to the second tween). The hash is ctx.hash (same FNV hash as v1 hashStr; v1 also fell back to the src attribute when an element had no id, here every element has an id). When rot is 0 the rotation tween is left out. Demo uses generated stickers instead of v1's round dots with symbols.",
